# Slice 293 probe: an omitted formal without a default is still the ordinary refusal of the call (the book :467 "Нет ни
# аргумента, ни допустимого дефолта — обычный отказ вызова"), beside a formal that has one.  Entry 7.
fn: e (int: x; int: y 7) int
    return: x * 10 + y
end: e
int: code 7
if: e(y: 3) != 3
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
